# registers/courts/sample.list (plan 1b.6): hashes only, never bytes or rows. Each hash is a RECORD of the MCP's courts
# corpus as support/mcpsource landed it (the record names its file by hash and url); a comment says what case the
# record proves, never whose it is. 30 October 2026, the first pull (5,611 records).
# The old estate's once-only listing (21 October 2026): a document, kept to report the judgments the corpus lacks.
